1 open rows (N33341 to N33341 in search order), each closed by C16 for squarefree n
(`not_hasSDS_of_cosetRow`) and the coset search on a quotient of order prime to n (generated by
`solver/a7rows.py`).
-/

@[expose] public section

namespace SignedDifferenceSets.CosetRows

set_option maxRecDepth 100000

theorem n33341_slice0 : cosetSlice [27] 13 141 2 4 29 2 0 5 = true := by
  decide +kernel

theorem n33341_slice1 : cosetSlice [27] 13 141 2 4 29 2 5 7 = true := by
  decide +kernel

